{"schema":1,"docId":"constitution","locale":"zh","contentVersion":"legal-lab-2026-10-15.2","id":7,"start":448,"units":[{"id":"constitution-u29bff5b0971e74b233-1","sectionId":"constitution-s104","locator":"第93条","text":"第93条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d40ad6c70a3e080b59df888b843b59bc37ad5581/","label":"第93条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u43dc268693e210aa5e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s104","locator":"第93条","text":"1. 联邦委员会只有依据国家杜马提出的叛国罪或实施其他严重犯罪的指控，且该指控经俄罗斯联邦最高法院关于在任或已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统行为具有犯罪特征的结论，以及俄罗斯联邦宪法法院关于遵守提出指控法定程序的结论确认后，方可免除俄罗斯联邦总统职务，或剥夺已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统的豁免权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d40ad6c70a3e080b59df888b843b59bc37ad5581/","label":"第1款 第93条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue58bbf9e095288fcdd-1","sectionId":"constitution-s104","locator":"第93条","text":"2. 国家杜马提出指控的决定，以及联邦委员会免除俄罗斯联邦总统职务或剥夺已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统豁免权的决定，必须由不少于三分之一的国家杜马代表发起，并在国家杜马设立的特别委员会出具结论的情况下，由相应院全体俄罗斯联邦参议员或国家杜马代表的三分之二票数通过。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d40ad6c70a3e080b59df888b843b59bc37ad5581/","label":"第2款 第93条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u84fd7f1410ca07928d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s104","locator":"第93条","text":"3. 联邦委员会关于免除俄罗斯联邦总统职务或剥夺已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统豁免权的决定，必须在国家杜马对俄罗斯联邦总统提出指控后三个月内作出。如联邦委员会未在该期限内作出决定，对俄罗斯联邦总统或已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统的指控视为被否决。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d40ad6c70a3e080b59df888b843b59bc37ad5581/","label":"第3款 第93条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u891bef869f52b73451-1","sectionId":"constitution-s105","locator":"第5章 联邦会议","text":"第5章 联邦会议","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d45a8b360fc46067c0f3eabffd74a3a0f1bf5f70/","label":"第5章 联邦会议","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ue92fdafe605be77313-1","sectionId":"constitution-s106","locator":"第94条","text":"第94条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b1cc9eda7877c41dda0c988cbd0c10ba155c9166/","label":"第94条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u6d814d46bbb9bdd566-1","sectionId":"constitution-s106","locator":"第94条","text":"联邦会议——俄罗斯联邦议会——是俄罗斯联邦的代表机关和立法机关。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b1cc9eda7877c41dda0c988cbd0c10ba155c9166/","label":"第94条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua595089e9f35497c32-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"第95条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第95条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u0ab1257fdfeb055c9a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"1. 联邦会议由两院组成，即联邦委员会和国家杜马。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第1款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9a20c8d03d040676ad-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"2. 联邦委员会由俄罗斯联邦参议员组成。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第2款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u90a81daa688f5c6935-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"联邦委员会成员包括：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第2款 第95条 · “联邦委员会成员包括：”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u93b27088b417076be4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"а) 每一俄罗斯联邦主体各两名代表，分别来自国家权力立法（代表）机关和行政机关各一名，任期与相应机关任期一致；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第«а»项 第2款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u89337954403a340a9a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"б) 因任期届满或因辞职而提前终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统，为终身成员。因任期届满或因辞职而提前终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统，有权放弃俄罗斯联邦参议员职权；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第«б»项 第2款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5974b0a56f4da1bf94-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"в) 由俄罗斯联邦总统任命的不超过30名俄罗斯联邦代表，其中不超过七名可以被任命为终身成员。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第«в»项 第2款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf1fc15340b3b49fa07-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦参议员总数，根据俄罗斯联邦宪法第65条列举的俄罗斯联邦主体的代表人数，以及本条第2款“б”项和“в”项所指行使俄罗斯联邦参议员职权的人数确定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第3款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9560c29c4c90d5e6e5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"4. 年满30岁、在俄罗斯联邦永久居住、不拥有外国国籍，亦不持有确认俄罗斯联邦公民有权在外国永久居留的居留证或其他文件的俄罗斯联邦公民，可以担任俄罗斯联邦参议员。依联邦法律规定的程序，禁止俄罗斯联邦参议员在位于俄罗斯联邦境外的外国银行开立和持有账户（存款）、存放现金和贵重物品。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第4款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua615b6ddb5c82d54ac-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"5. 在国家和社会活动领域对国家作出杰出贡献的公民，可以被任命为在联邦委员会中终身行使俄罗斯联邦参议员职权的俄罗斯联邦代表。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第5款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u1b02f6f4c4e1b45b8c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"6. 俄罗斯联邦在联邦委员会中的代表，除终身行使俄罗斯联邦参议员职权者外，任命期限为六年。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第6款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u387e9cf3e3de0c6bf6-1","sectionId":"constitution-s107","locator":"第95条","text":"7. 国家杜马由450名代表组成。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a966cb7bf74cfc516528e2d2b8b56ae756147013/","label":"第7款 第95条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue790d24e32df988904-1","sectionId":"constitution-s108","locator":"第96条","text":"第96条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/61e68127368c3047081b302a235c939f5aa26805/","label":"第96条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u9f0591e421098544ac-1","sectionId":"constitution-s108","locator":"第96条","text":"1. 国家杜马经选举产生，任期五年<20>。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/61e68127368c3047081b302a235c939f5aa26805/","label":"第1款 第96条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7291a64223df0911ce-1","sectionId":"constitution-s108","locator":"第96条","text":"2. 联邦委员会的组成程序和国家杜马代表的选举程序，由联邦法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/61e68127368c3047081b302a235c939f5aa26805/","label":"第2款 第96条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8aa0ebf76493a8431e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s108","locator":"第96条","text":"<20> 第1款采用2008年12月30日第6-ФКЗ号《关于改变俄罗斯联邦总统和国家杜马任期》的俄罗斯联邦宪法修正法律所规定的版本；该法自2008年12月31日正式公布之日起生效（《俄罗斯报》，2008年12月31日）。适用于该法生效后选举产生的国家杜马。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/61e68127368c3047081b302a235c939f5aa26805/","label":"第96条 · “<20> 第1款采用2008年12月30日第6-ФКЗ号《关于改变俄罗斯联邦总统和国家杜马任期》的俄罗斯联邦宪法修正法律所规定的…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua721c20bd3a93de90e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s109","locator":"第97条","text":"第97条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b609d63d916e795b53c1e27dc4df3ff8d994a0b9/","label":"第97条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u7cd2e8520824f43604-1","sectionId":"constitution-s109","locator":"第97条","text":"1. 年满21岁、享有参加选举的权利、在俄罗斯联邦永久居住、不拥有外国国籍，亦不持有确认俄罗斯联邦公民有权在外国永久居留的居留证或其他文件的俄罗斯联邦公民，可以当选国家杜马代表。依联邦法律规定的程序，禁止国家杜马代表在位于俄罗斯联邦境外的外国银行开立和持有账户（存款）、存放现金和贵重物品。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b609d63d916e795b53c1e27dc4df3ff8d994a0b9/","label":"第1款 第97条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue01d8f4610ac45188d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s109","locator":"第97条","text":"2. 同一人不得同时担任俄罗斯联邦参议员和国家杜马代表。国家杜马代表不得担任其他国家权力代表机关和地方自治机关的代表。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b609d63d916e795b53c1e27dc4df3ff8d994a0b9/","label":"第2款 第97条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uedca7656ebce71fc34-1","sectionId":"constitution-s109","locator":"第97条","text":"3. 国家杜马代表实行专职常任制。国家杜马代表不得担任国家公务，不得从事教学、科研和其他创作活动以外的其他有报酬活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b609d63d916e795b53c1e27dc4df3ff8d994a0b9/","label":"第3款 第97条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0d9a403157ebe8b837-1","sectionId":"constitution-s110","locator":"第98条","text":"第98条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8a2b5038405363abf2bfc4d012f0a9d9dd421c77/","label":"第98条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ue57fe0cb35b3a02874-1","sectionId":"constitution-s110","locator":"第98条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦参议员和国家杜马代表在整个任期内享有豁免权。除在犯罪现场被当场拘留外，不得对其拘留、逮捕或搜查；除联邦法律为保障他人安全作出规定的情形外，也不得对其进行人身检查。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8a2b5038405363abf2bfc4d012f0a9d9dd421c77/","label":"第1款 第98条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u341f60931ba5ae1e2a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s110","locator":"第98条","text":"2. 剥夺豁免权的问题，由联邦会议相应院根据俄罗斯联邦总检察长的提请决定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8a2b5038405363abf2bfc4d012f0a9d9dd421c77/","label":"第2款 第98条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8e00507a4f33ed0db1-1","sectionId":"constitution-s111","locator":"第99条","text":"第99条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4777b3ea56f0dd9ddfe8686104aa20cb400b7bdb/","label":"第99条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u17838d3aa5f225b9c7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s111","locator":"第99条","text":"1. 联邦会议为常设机关。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4777b3ea56f0dd9ddfe8686104aa20cb400b7bdb/","label":"第1款 第99条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf7b62993089364f371-1","sectionId":"constitution-s111","locator":"第99条","text":"2. 国家杜马在选举后的第三十日举行第一次会议。俄罗斯联邦总统可以在此之前召集国家杜马会议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4777b3ea56f0dd9ddfe8686104aa20cb400b7bdb/","label":"第2款 第99条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub25b7362f53c04cbdb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s111","locator":"第99条","text":"3. 国家杜马第一次会议由年龄最大的代表宣布开幕。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4777b3ea56f0dd9ddfe8686104aa20cb400b7bdb/","label":"第3款 第99条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u882b4096c7fb90ba7d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s111","locator":"第99条","text":"4. 自新一届国家杜马开始工作之时起，上届国家杜马的职权终止。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/4777b3ea56f0dd9ddfe8686104aa20cb400b7bdb/","label":"第4款 第99条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub569736ccc578dec01-1","sectionId":"constitution-s112","locator":"第100条","text":"第100条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c29eea3947a621f8f8266c9506cf256ef103eb41/","label":"第100条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u85c194901db3a927e0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s112","locator":"第100条","text":"1. 联邦委员会和国家杜马分别举行会议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c29eea3947a621f8f8266c9506cf256ef103eb41/","label":"第1款 第100条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud9b9b20dd4dbd7bbc2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s112","locator":"第100条","text":"2. 联邦委员会和国家杜马会议公开举行。各院有权在本院议事规则规定的情形下举行闭门会议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c29eea3947a621f8f8266c9506cf256ef103eb41/","label":"第2款 第100条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u3b549a82f9c8818a00-1","sectionId":"constitution-s112","locator":"第100条","text":"3. 两院可以举行联席会议，听取俄罗斯联邦总统咨文。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c29eea3947a621f8f8266c9506cf256ef103eb41/","label":"第3款 第100条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uff6ae599c31ae0b203-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"第101条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第101条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u69915e7e94698ad33e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"1. 联邦委员会从其成员中选举联邦委员会主席及副主席。国家杜马从其成员中选举国家杜马主席及副主席。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第1款 第101条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u743e89cc129400bdd4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"2. 联邦委员会主席及副主席、国家杜马主席及副主席主持会议，并负责本院内部工作秩序。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第2款 第101条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9a4bf8f58c250c4c28-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"3. 联邦委员会和国家杜马设立委员会和专门委员会，就各自管辖事项举行议会听证。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第3款 第101条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u549e800ee9a412adbf-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"4. 各院通过自己的议事规则，并决定本院活动的内部工作秩序事项。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第4款 第101条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u92d88bf4ef78a58dc2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s113","locator":"第101条","text":"5. 为监督联邦预算的执行，联邦委员会和国家杜马设立审计院，其组成和活动程序由联邦法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/45373134b98aceb6825ae110237c4adbc2b0eaaa/","label":"第5款 第101条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6bb76617102fb4927a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"第102条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第102条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u899c795fce952a6fcb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"1. 联邦委员会管辖下列事项：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud89a8a9425ee7ec7d9-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"а) 批准俄罗斯联邦主体之间边界的变更；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«а»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf4cb24344b02183d12-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"б) 批准俄罗斯联邦总统关于实行军事管制的总统令；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«б»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua50438748b9982d335-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"в) 批准俄罗斯联邦总统关于实行紧急状态的总统令；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«в»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u22800584f1dde4aa57-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"г) 决定是否可以在俄罗斯联邦境外使用俄罗斯联邦武装力量；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«г»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6bbde71a6479339565-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"д) 决定举行俄罗斯联邦总统选举；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«д»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2c70763cf425521a05-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"е) 免除俄罗斯联邦总统职务；剥夺已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统的豁免权；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«е»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u84e5bc446350e1d2b4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"ж) 根据俄罗斯联邦总统的提请，任命俄罗斯联邦宪法法院院长、副院长和法官，以及俄罗斯联邦最高法院院长、副院长和法官；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«ж»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uabe524a9de9878d6e3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"з) 就俄罗斯联邦总统提出的俄罗斯联邦总检察长、副总检察长、俄罗斯联邦主体检察长以及与俄罗斯联邦主体检察长同级的军事和其他专门检察机关检察长人选进行协商；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«з»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf8e6877345d0f4df75-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"и) 根据俄罗斯联邦总统的提请，任免审计院院长及审计员总数的一半；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«и»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u21b10609fc01ee2578-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"к) 就俄罗斯联邦总统提出的主管国防、国家安全、内务、司法、外交、预防紧急情况和消除自然灾害后果以及公共安全事务的联邦行政机关负责人（包括联邦部长）人选进行协商；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«к»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u59941df0a28e61e2e2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"л) 对俄罗斯联邦宪法法院院长、副院长和法官，俄罗斯联邦最高法院院长、副院长和法官，以及撤销审法院和上诉法院院长、副院长和法官，如其实施有损法官荣誉和尊严的行为，或存在联邦宪法性法律规定的其他表明法官无法行使职权的情形，根据俄罗斯联邦总统的提请，依联邦宪法性法律终止其职权；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«л»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5f35286639858e5821-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"м) 听取俄罗斯联邦总检察长关于俄罗斯联邦法制和法律秩序状况的年度报告。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第«м»项 第1款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u1cadaf793f143c6de9-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"2. 联邦委员会就俄罗斯联邦宪法规定属于其管辖的事项通过决议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第2款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub1715308ab9b889cde-1","sectionId":"constitution-s114","locator":"第102条","text":"3. 联邦委员会决议由俄罗斯联邦参议员总数的多数票通过，但俄罗斯联邦宪法规定其他决策程序的除外。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/97ecab658ead741720b5999f905a4e0cb20c024a/","label":"第3款 第102条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u765fcd18efc2b22368-1","sectionId":"constitution-s115","locator":"第103条","text":"第103条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/0612b6bbbb0489d5f4f28a71c7305f85af06b235/","label":"第103条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u9d4dbf366b62cb64d2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s115","locator":"第103条","text":"1. 国家杜马管辖下列事项：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/0612b6bbbb0489d5f4f28a71c7305f85af06b235/","label":"第1款 第103条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u90c038e2536dfea8cd-1","sectionId":"constitution-s115","locator":"第103条","text":"а) 根据俄罗斯联邦总统的提请，批准俄罗斯联邦政府主席人选；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/0612b6bbbb0489d5f4f28a71c7305f85af06b235/","label":"第«а»项 第1款 第103条","heading":false}]}
